description:
Design a two-bit encoder that outputs a one-bit signal based on the most significant bit of the input and indicates whether the input data is zero. The output `q` reflects the value of `data[1]`, while the output `zero` is asserted high if both input bits are low, effectively signaling a zero condition when no active input is present.
module top_module(
    input [1:0] data,
    output reg q,
    output reg zero
);

